    blendShareMeanPct: m.blendShareMeanPct, blendShareP25: m.blendShareP25, blendShareP75: m.blendShareP75,
    steerShareMeanPct: m.steerShareMeanPct, saturTotalS: m.saturTotalS, saturDrivesN: m.saturDrivesN, saturCoverageN: m.saturCoverageN,
    // M42 (2026-07-17): near-limiter headroom census, computed risk row,
